{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49497","headline":"虞美人 二 · 顾敻","name":"虞美人 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"触帘风送景阳钟，鸳被绣花重。\n晓帏初卷冷烟浓，翠匀粉黛好仪容，思娇慵。\n起来无语理朝妆，宝匣镜凝光。\n绿荷相倚满池塘，露清枕簟藕花香，恨悠扬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}